  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Rights, Our Future!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action aims to improve the conditions that enable a diverse and independent civil society, as well as grassroots movements and activists (particularly underrepresented and marginalised youth) in 4 key regions (Southeast Asia, Africa, Middle East, Latin America).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Global with project management based in Bogota, Colombia. 4 regions (Southeast Asia, Africa, Middle East, Latin America) and 9 countries (Colombia, Eswatini, Tunisia, Palestine, Brazil, Senegal, Kenya, Indonesia, and Sri Lanka) are targeted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stemming from the thematic human rights FFPA on Freedom of Association and peaceful Assembly with ForumCiv, COSPE and CCPR.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
